Para resolver o erro **"already exists"** no Supabase e o **"ERRO DE CONEXÃO"** no painel, precisamos de um script SQL que limpe as políticas antigas antes de criar as novas e de uma configuração correta no código.

### 1. Novo Script SQL (Copie e Cole no SQL Editor do Supabase)
Este script usa `DROP POLICY IF EXISTS` para evitar o erro que você recebeu. Ele vai "resetar" as permissões e garantir que tudo funcione.

```sql
-- 1. CRIAR TABELAS (Caso não existam)
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS events (
  id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  day TEXT, month TEXT, title TEXT NOT NULL, location TEXT, 
  image_url TEXT, label TEXT, featured BOOLEAN DEFAULT false, price TEXT
);

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS videos (
  id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  title TEXT NOT NULL, category TEXT, thumbnail TEXT, video_url TEXT, duration TEXT
);

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS articles (
  id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  title TEXT NOT NULL, excerpt TEXT, content TEXT, category TEXT, read_time TEXT, image_url TEXT
);

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS interactions (
  id UUID DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
  content_id TEXT NOT NULL, user_insta TEXT NOT NULL, type TEXT NOT NULL, text TEXT
);

-- 2. LIMPAR POLÍTICAS ANTIGAS (Para evitar o erro 'already exists')
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Leitura Pública" ON events;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Admin Total" ON events;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Acesso Público Leitura" ON events;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Admin All" ON events;

DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Acesso Público Leitura Videos" ON videos;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Admin All Videos" ON videos;

DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Acesso Público Leitura Articles" ON articles;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Admin All Articles" ON articles;

DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Público Insere" ON interactions;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Público Lê" ON interactions;

-- 3. HABILITAR SEGURANÇA (RLS)
ALTER TABLE events ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE videos ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE articles ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE interactions ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

-- 4. CRIAR NOVAS POLÍTICAS
CREATE POLICY "Public Read Events" ON events FOR SELECT USING (true);
CREATE POLICY "Admin All Events" ON events FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);

CREATE POLICY "Public Read Videos" ON videos FOR SELECT USING (true);
CREATE POLICY "Admin All Videos" ON videos FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);

CREATE POLICY "Public Read Articles" ON articles FOR SELECT USING (true);
CREATE POLICY "Admin All Articles" ON articles FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);

CREATE POLICY "Public Interaction" ON interactions FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
```

